{x}^{2}$ is not $5.$ Therefore, to find the desired equation, we multiply the equation above by $5.$ This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5({x}^{2}+\\frac{36}{5}) & =0 \\\\ 5{x}^{2}+36 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534538 true] [17592186293774 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293775 13194139534538 true] [17592186293774 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293776 13194139534538 true] [17592186293774 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293777 13194139534538 true] [17592186293774 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293778 13194139534538 true] [17592186293774 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293779 13194139534538 true] [17592186293774 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534538 true] [17592186293774 1041 "selection" 13194139534538 true] [17592186293774 1104 #edb/ref 17592186293775 13194139534538 true] [17592186293774 1110 #uuid "83039dd7-8a14-516b-9035-ef61fada170d" 13194139534538 true] [17592186293775 1034 "5{x}^{2}+36=0" 13194139534538 true] [17592186293775 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534538 true] [17592186293775 1111 #uuid "75ec5e80-fa08-513c-9949-e9f4db637821" 13194139534538 true] [17592186293776 1034 "5{x}^{2}-36=0" 13194139534538 true] [17592186293776 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534538 true] [17592186293776 1111 #uuid "5b0316d5-e883-5c31-95ca-96805a19136d" 13194139534538 true] [17592186293777 1034 "5{x}^{2}+6=0" 13194139534538 true] [17592186293777 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534538 true] [17592186293777 1111 #uuid "ccd1a6fa-ece0-538a-bf74-66a6f8e7380c" 13194139534538 true] [17592186293778 1034 "5{x}^{2}+x-6=0" 13194139534538 true] [17592186293778 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534538 true] [17592186293778 1111 #uuid "e5a41398-f1a7-5432-9465-da17943fa0b6" 13194139534538 true] [17592186293779 1034 "5{x}^{2}+2x+36=0" 13194139534538 true] [17592186293779 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534538 true] [17592186293779 1111 #uuid "47db38ef-94d6-524d-b228-ca247ffdcee7" 13194139534538 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-281349" 17592186293760 "q-281349/field-1" 17592186293761 "q-281349/field-1/f47866c0465123759f